# =============================================================================
# Root .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# Previously this was an allowlist that published only 00_ARXiv_Code and the
# README. After merging the UCL builder/linter work, the repo also tracks
# UCL_LINTER/ (library, tests, docs, web app) and .github/ (CI + Pages).

# SECURITY: never commit secrets
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
build/
dist/
venv/
.venv/

# OS / editors
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
